WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.490
Unit ten. Caring for My Eyes!

2
00:00:04.442 --> 00:00:08.335
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.385 --> 00:00:11.953
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.003 --> 00:00:15.952
Today we learn about Caring for My Eyes. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.671 --> 00:00:20.255
Eyes. Say it with me. Eyes!

6
00:00:23.755 --> 00:00:27.072
See. Say it with me. See!

7
00:00:30.578 --> 00:00:33.728
Rub. Say it with me. Rub!

8
00:00:37.233 --> 00:00:40.833
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

9
00:00:44.337 --> 00:00:47.970
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

10
00:00:51.466 --> 00:00:54.766
Light. Say it with me. Light!

11
00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:02.034
Glasses. Say it with me. Glasses!

12
00:01:05.536 --> 00:01:08.886
Doctor. Say it with me. Doctor!

13
00:01:12.393 --> 00:01:23.359
My eyes help me see the world. I do not rub my eyes with dirty hands. I rest my eyes from a screen and read in good light. If I cannot see well, a doctor may give me glasses.

14
00:01:23.409 --> 00:01:24.663
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.009 --> 00:01:31.499
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.549 --> 00:01:32.699
Rub!

17
00:01:33.502 --> 00:01:38.704
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.754 --> 00:01:39.904
Glasses!

19
00:01:40.969 --> 00:01:46.045
Did you know? Playing outside in daylight is good for children's eyes!

20
00:01:46.095 --> 00:01:48.144
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.865 --> 00:01:56.177
Think and answer. How can you look after your eyes?

22
00:01:56.227 --> 00:01:57.377
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.553 --> 00:02:03.475
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.525 --> 00:02:06.295
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

